I</td><td>x</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Ezpada AG</td><td>CH</td><td>x</td><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>FLEXGRID d.o.o.</td><td>SI</td><td>x</td><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>GEN Energija, d.o.o.</td><td>SI</td><td>x</td><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>GEN-I d.o.o.</td><td>SI</td><td>x</td><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>HEP d.d.</td><td>HR</td><td>x</td><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>Holding Slovenske elektrarne d.o.o.</td><td>SI</td><td>MM</td><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>Javno podjetje Energetika Ljubljana d.o.o.</td><td>SI</td><td>x</td><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>Kelag International Ljubljana d.o.o.</td><td>SI</td><td>x</td><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>Kolektor sETup d.o.o.</td><td>SI</td><td>x</td><td>x</td></tr><tr><td><span>Metlen Energy &amp; Metals S.A.</span></td><td>GR</td><td>x</td><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>MVM Partner ZRt.</td><td>HU</td><td>x</td><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>NGEN, energetske rešitve d.o.o.</td><td>SI</td><td>x</td><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>Nidhog ApS</td><td>DK</td><td>x</td><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>Nord Energy Oy</td><td>FI</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>Norlys Energy Trading A/S</td><td>DK</td><td>x</td><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>Petrol d.d.</td><td>SI</td><td>LP</td><td>LP</td></tr><tr><td>Second Foundation Trading AG</td><td>CH</td><td>x</td><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>Sky Quant sp. z o.o.</td><td>PL</td><td>x</td><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>Sors Markets Norway AS</td><td>NO</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>SunContract d.o.o.</td><td>SI</td><td>x</td><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>THN Capital AG</td><td>CH</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>x</td></tr><tr><td>Vitol Gas &amp; Power BV</td><td>NL</td><td>x</td><td>x</td></tr></tbody></table><p>MM – Market Maker&nbsp;<br>LP – Liquidity Provider&nbsp;</p><p>Members are present on Slovenian Market by themselves or with their affiliate companies.</p></div>
      
      </div>
      </details>
</div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field--item node--page--full--item node--full--item" data-item-delta="1">  <div class="paragraph paragraph-section paragraph--default paragraph-section-default paragraph-background-1 section-background-white paragraph-hide-on-screen--xs--visible paragraph-hide-on-screen--sm--visible paragraph-hide-on-screen--md--visible spacing-section-vertical-default-top spacing-section-vertical-default-bottom paragraph--type--section paragraph--view-mode--default" data-entity-type="paragraph" data-bundle="section" data-view-mode="default" data-entity-id="7662" data-paragraph-type="section" data-paragraph-id="7662" data-fullwidth-paragraph>
            <div class="layout layout--onecol">
    <div class="section-content-container">

      <div  class="layout__region layout__region--content">
          <h2  class="paragraph paragraph-section_title paragraph--default paragraph-section_title-default spacing-paragraph-right-no spacing-paragraph-left-no paragraph-text-align-left spacing-paragraph-vertical-tiny-bottom paragraph--type--section-title paragraph--view-mode--default h2" data-entity-type="paragraph" data-bundle="section_title" data-view-mode="default" data-entity-id="7663" data-paragraph-type="section_title" data-paragraph-id="7663">
      
            <div data-item-count="1" data-field-entity-type="paragraph" data-field-entity-bundle="section_title" data-field-entity-view-mode="default" data-field-name="field_title" data-field-type="string" class="field field--name--field_title field--type--string field--label--hidden paragraph--section-title--default--field-title paragraph--default--field-title field--name-field-title field--type-string field--label-hidden paragraph--section_title--default--item paragraph--default--item field--item">Become a Member</div>
      

    </h2>
  <div class="paragraph paragraph-text paragraph--default paragraph-text-default spacing-paragraph-right-no spacing-paragraph-left-no spacing-paragraph-vertical-default-bottom paragraph--type--text paragraph--view-mode--default" data-entity-type="paragraph" data-bundle="text" data-view-mode="default" data-entity-id="7664" data-paragraph-type="text" data-paragraph-id="7664">
          
            <div data-item-count="1" data-field-entity-type="paragraph" data-field-entity-bundle="text" data-field-entity-view-mode="default" data-field-name="field_text" data-field-type="text_long" class="field field--name--field_text field--type--text_long field--label--hidden paragraph--text--default--field-text paragraph--default--field-text field--name-field-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden paragraph--text--default--item paragraph--default--item field--item"><p>In order to become a member of the BSP Energy Exchange, interested parties must meet certain prerequisites.</p><p>The establishment of a balance group with the Slovenian Power Market Operator Borzen<br>Membership with ECC Clearing house as a Non-Clearing Member (NCM) or Direct Clearing participant (DCP)<br>Admission process:</p><p>After meeting the necessary requirements, applicants shall submit all forms and supporting documents either by sending the physical copies to BSP or by emailing them to <a href="mailto:membership@bsp-southpool.com.">membership@bsp-southpool.com</a>.</p><p>Exchange participation form<br>Market participation form<br>KYC form<br>Supporting documentation<br>Once all required documents are received, the exchange will issue a Decision regarding acceptance into membership and prepare relevant Agreements. Upon signing the accession documents and paying the membership fee, the applicant becomes a member of the exchange.</p><p>Complete list of exchange members can be accessed through the official websites of BSP and Adex.</p></div>
      
      </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field--item node--page--full--item node--full--item" data-item-delta="2">  <div class="paragraph paragraph-section paragraph--default paragraph-section-default paragraph-background-1 section-background-white paragraph-hide-on-screen--xs--visible paragraph-hide-on-screen--sm--visible paragraph-hide-on-screen--md--visible spacing-section-vertical-default-top spacing-section-vertical-default-bottom paragraph--type--section paragraph--view-mode--default" data-entity-type="paragraph" data-bundle="section" data-view-mode="default" data-entity-id="7665" data-paragraph-type="section" data-paragraph-id="7665" data-fullwidth-paragraph>
            <div class="layout layout--onecol">
    <div class="section-content-container">

      <div  class="layout__region layout__region--content">
          <h2  class="paragraph paragraph-section_title paragraph--default paragraph-section_title-default spacing-paragraph-right-no spacing-paragraph-left-no paragraph-text-align-left spacing-paragraph-vertical-tiny-bottom paragraph--type--section-title paragraph--view-mode--default h2" data-entity-type="paragraph" data-bundle="section_title" data-view-mode="default" data-entity-id="7666" data-paragraph-type="section_title" data-paragraph-id="7666">
      
            <div data-item-count="1" data-field-entity-type="paragraph" data-field-entity-bundle="section_title" data-field-entity-view-mode="default" data-field-name="field_title" data-field-type="string" class="field field--name--field_title field--type--string field--label--hidden paragraph--section-title--default--field-title paragraph--default--field-title field--name-field-title field--type-string field--label-hidden paragraph--section_title--default--item paragraph--default--item field--item">Exchange Bodies</div>
      

    </h2>
<div class="paragraph paragraph-accordion paragraph--default paragraph-accordion-default spacing-paragraph-right-no spacing-paragraph-left-no spacing-paragraph-vertical-default-bottom paragraph--type--accordion paragraph--view-mode--default" data-entity-type="paragraph" data-bundle="accordion" data-view-mode="default" data-entity-id="7672" data-paragraph-type="accordion" data-paragraph-id="7672">
  <details>
          <summary>
        
            <div data-item-count="1" data-field-entity-type="paragraph" data-field-entity-bundle="accordion" data-field-entity-view-mode="default" data-field-name="field_title" data-field-type="string" class="field field--name--field_title field--type--string field--label--hidden paragraph--accordion--default--field-title paragraph--default--field-title field--name-field-title field--type-string field--label-hidden paragraph--accordion--default--item paragraph--default--item field--item">Management</div>
      
        
        <span class="icon"></span>
      </summary>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        
            <div data-item-count="1" data-field-entity-type="paragraph" data-field-entity-bundle="accordion" data-field-entity-view-mode="default" data-field-name="field_text" data-field-type="text_long" class="field field--name--field_text field--type--text_long field--label--hidden paragraph--accordion--default--field-text paragraph--default--field-text field--name-field-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden paragraph--accordion--default--item paragraph--default--item field--item"><p>is the body managing the BSP operations and determing the general directions of BSP strategy and development.&nbsp;</p><p><a href="/about#management"><span class="highlight"><strong>View</strong></span></a></p></div>
      
      </div>
      </details>
</div>
<div class="paragraph paragraph-accordion paragraph--default paragraph-accordion-default spacing-paragraph-right-no spacing-paragraph-left-no spacing-paragraph-vertical-default-bottom paragraph--type--accordion paragraph--view-mode--default" data-entity-type="paragraph" data-bundle="accordion" data-view-mode="default" data-entity-id="7673" data-paragraph-type="accordion" data-paragraph-id="7673">
  <details>
          <summary>
        
            <div data-item-count="1" data-field-entity-type="paragraph" data-field-entity-bundle="accordion" data-field-entity-view-mode="default" data-field-name="field_title" data-field-type="string" class="field field--name--field_title field--type--string field--label--hidden paragraph--accordion--default--field-title paragraph--default--field-title field--name-field-title field--type-string field--label-hidden paragraph--accordion--default--item paragraph--default--item field--item">Market Supervision</div>
      
        
        <span class="icon"></span>
      </summary>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        
            <div data-item-count="1" data-field-entity-type="paragraph" data-field-entity-bundle="accordion" data-field-entity-view-mode="default" data-field-name="field_text" data-field-type="text_long" class="field field--name--field_text field--type--text_long field--label--hidden paragraph--accordion--default--field-text paragraph--default--field-text field--name-field-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden paragraph--accordion--default--item paragraph--default--item field--item"><p>is the body overseeing and monitoring the entire trading process and management of the trading system in accordance with the rules.&nbsp;</p><p><a href="https://www.bsp-southpool.com/"><span class="highlight"><strong>View</strong></span></a></p></div>
      
      </div>
      </details>
</div>
<div class="paragraph paragraph-accordion paragraph--default paragraph-accordion-default spacing-paragraph-right-no spacing-paragraph-left-no spacing-paragraph-vertical-default-bottom paragraph--type--accordion paragraph--view-mode--default" data-entity-type="paragraph" data-bundle="accordion" data-view-mode="default" data-entity-id="7674" data-paragraph-type="accordion" data-paragraph-id="7674">
  <details>
          <summary>
        
            <div data-item-count="1" data-field-entity-type="paragraph" data-field-entity-bundle="accordion" data-field-entity-view-mode="default" data-field-name="field_title" data-field-type="string" class="field field--name--field_title field--type--string field--label--hidden paragraph--accordion--default--field-title paragraph--default--field-title field--name-field-title field--type-string field--label-hidden paragraph--accordion--default--item paragraph--default--item field--item">Exchange Arbitration</div>
      
        
        <span class="icon"></span>
      </summary>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        
            <div data-item-count="1" data-field-entity-type="paragraph" data-field-entity-bundle="accordion" data-field-entity-view-mode="default" data-field-name="field_text" data-field-type="text_long" class="field field--name--field_text field--type--text_long field--label--hidden paragraph--accordion--default--field-text paragraph--default--field-text field--name-field-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden paragraph--accordion--default--item paragraph--default--item field--item"><p>is a permanent, specialised and independent exchange body, which will enable fast and confidential dispute resolution that results from or in connection with trading, clearing and any other exchange operations involving BSP and/or its services in accordance with the rules;</p><p><a href="/sites/default/files/media/file/2025/11/BSP_Rules_-_Exchange_Rules_v3.0.pdf"><span class="highlight"><strong>Download</strong></span></a></p></div>
      
      </div>
      </details>
</div>
<div class="paragraph paragraph-accordion paragraph--default paragraph-accordion-default spacing-paragraph-right-no spacing-paragraph-left-no spacing-paragraph-vertical-default-bottom paragraph--type--accordion paragraph--view-mode--default" data-entity-type="paragraph" data-bundle="accordion" data-view-mode="default" data-entity-id="7675" data-paragraph-type="accordion" data-paragraph-id="7675">
  <details>
          <summary>
        
            <div data-item-count="1" data-field-entity-type="paragraph" data-field-entity-bundle="accordion" data-field-entity-view-mode="default" data-field-name="field_title" data-field-type="string" class="field field--name--field_title field--type--string field--label--hidden paragraph--accordion--default--field-title paragraph--default--field-title field--name-field-title field--type-string field--label-hidden paragraph--accordion--default--item paragraph--default--item field--item">Members Chamber</div>
      
        
        <span class="icon"></span>
      </summary>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        
            <div data-item-count="1" data-field-entity-type="paragraph" data-field-entity-bundle="accordion" data-field-entity-view-mode="default" data-field-name="field_text" data-field-type="text_long" class="field field--name--field_text field--type--text_long field--label--hidden paragraph--accordion--default--field-text paragraph--default--field-text field--name-field-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden paragraph--accordion--default--item paragraph--default--item field--item"><p>is the body representing interests of all exchange participants in relation to BSP.</p></div>
      
      </div>
      </details>
</div>
<div class="paragraph paragraph-accordion paragraph--default paragraph-accordion-default spacing-paragraph-right-no spacing-paragraph-left-no spacing-paragraph-vertical-default-bottom paragraph--type--accordion paragraph--view-mode--default" data-entity-type="paragraph" data-bundle="accordion" data-view-mode="default" data-entity-id="7676" data-paragraph-type="accordion" data-paragraph-id="7676">
  <details>
          <summary>
        
            <div data-item-count="1" data-field-entity-type="paragraph" data-field-entity-bundle="accordion" data-field-entity-view-mode="default" data-field-name="field_title" data-field-type="string" class="field field--name--field_title field--type--string field--label--hidden paragraph--accordion--default--field-title paragraph--default--field-title field--name-field-title field--type-string field--label-hidden paragraph--accordion--default--item paragraph--default--item field--item">Exchange Council</div>
      
        
        <span class="icon"></span>
      </summary>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        
            <div data-item-count="1" data-field-entity-type="paragraph" data-field-entity-bundle="accordion" data-field-entity-view-mode="default" data-field-name="field_text" data-field-type="text_long" class="field field--name--field_text field--type--text_long field--label--hidden paragraph--accordion--default--field-text paragraph--default--field-text field--name-field-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden paragraph--accordion--default--item paragraph--default--item field--item"><p>Members Chamber is lead by Exchange Council that also coordinates the work of Members Chamber and Market Committees.</p></div>
      
      </div>
      </details>
</div>
<div class="paragraph paragraph-accordion paragraph--default paragraph-accordion-default spacing-paragraph-right-no spacing-paragraph-left-no spacing-paragraph-vertical-default-bottom paragraph--type--accordion paragraph--view-mode--default" data-entity-type="paragraph" data-bundle="accordion" data-view-mode="default" data-entity-id="7677" data-paragraph-type="accordion" data-paragraph-id="7677">
  <details>
          <summary>
        
            <div data-item-count="1" data-field-entity-type="paragraph" data-field-entity-bundle="accordion" data-field-entity-view-mode="default" data-field-name="field_title" data-field-type="string" class="field field--name--field_title field--type--string field--label--hidden paragraph--accordion--default--field-title paragraph--default--field-title field--name-field-title field--type-string field--label-hidden paragraph--accordion--default--item paragraph--default--item field--item">Market Committee</div>
      
        
        <span class="icon"></span>
      </summary>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        
            <div data-item-count="1" data-field-entity-type="paragraph" data-field-entity-bundle="accordion" data-field-entity-view-mode="default" data-field-name="field_text" data-field-type="text_long" class="field field--name--field_text field--type--text_long field--label--hidden paragraph--accordion--default--field-text paragraph--default--field-text field--name-field-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden paragraph--accordion--default--item paragraph--default--item field--item"><p>is the body representing interests of exchange participants active in the individual country of BSP operation in relation to Members Chamber.</p></div>
      
      </div>
      </details>
</div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field--item node--page--full--item node--full--item" data-item-delta="3">  <div class="paragraph paragraph-section paragraph--default paragraph-section-default paragraph-background-1 section-background-white paragraph-hide-on-screen--xs--visible paragraph-hide-on-screen--sm--visible paragraph-hide-on-screen--md--visible spacing-section-vertical-default-top spacing-section-vertical-default-bottom paragraph--type--section paragraph--view-mode--default" data-entity-type="paragraph" data-bundle="section" data-view-mode="default" data-entity-id="7668" data-paragraph-type="section" data-paragraph-id="7668" data-fullwidth-paragraph>
            <div class="layout layout--onecol">
    <div class="section-content-container">

      <div  class="layout__region layout__region--content">
          <h2  class="paragraph paragraph-section_title paragraph--default paragraph-section_title-default spacing-paragraph-right-no spacing-paragraph-left-no paragraph-text-align-left spacing-paragraph-vertical-tiny-bottom paragraph--type--section-title paragraph--view-mode--default h2" data-entity-type="paragraph" data-bundle="section_title" data-view-mode="default" data-entity-id="7669" data-paragraph-type="section_title" data-paragraph-id="7669">
      
            <div data-item-count="1" data-field-entity-type="paragraph" data-field-entity-bundle="section_title" data-field-entity-view-mode="default" data-field-name="field_title" data-field-type="string" class="field field--name--field_title field--type--string field--label--hidden paragraph--section-title--default--field-title paragraph--default--field-title field--name-field-title field--type-string field--label-hidden paragraph--section_title--default--item paragraph--default--item field--item">Software Vendors</div>
      

    </h2>
  <div class="paragraph paragraph-text paragraph--default paragraph-text-default spacing-paragraph-right-no spacing-paragraph-left-no spacing-paragraph-vertical-default-bottom paragraph--type--text paragraph--view-mode--default" data-entity-type="paragraph" data-bundle="text" data-view-mode="default" data-entity-id="7670" data-paragraph-type="text" data-paragraph-id="7670">
          
            <div data-item-count="1" data-field-entity-type="paragraph" data-field-entity-bundle="text" data-field-entity-view-mode="default" data-field-name="field_text" data-field-type="text_long" class="field field--name--field_text field--type--text_long field--label--hidden paragraph--text--default--field-text paragraph--default--field-text field--name-field-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden paragraph--text--default--item paragraph--default--item field--item"><div><p>ISV (Independent Software Vendor) partners create innovative software that seamlessly integrates with BSP's systems using API. This collaboration ensures smooth and efficient operation for all users.</p><p>BSP, along with our ISV partners, actively collaborates to develop and deliver customized, innovative solutions to meet the diverse needs of our Members.</p><p>The following independent software vendor (ISV) partners have already begun working with BSP to collaboratively create software solutions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://www.powerbot-trading.com/" target="_blank">PowerBot GmbH</a></td><td><a href="mailto:office@powerbot-trading.com">office@powerbot-trading.com</a></td><td>+43 720 9000 18</td><td><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src="/sites/default/files/media/image/2026/01/PB-logo-black-RGB.png" alt width="290" height="44"></p><p>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://www.energyone.com/" target="_blank">Energy One Group</a></td><td><a href="mailto:sales@energyone.com">sales@energyone.com</a></td><td>+33 183 641 758</td><td><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src="https:/sites/default/files/media/image/2026/01/Energy%20One%20BLUE%20PNG%20-%20good%20quality.png" alt width="288" height="54"></p></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://www.volue.com/" target="_blank">Volue Germany GmbH</a></td><td><a href="mailto:Volue-Sales-Europe@volue.com">Volue-Sales-Europe@volue.com</a></td><td>+48 533 480 263</td><td><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src="/sites/default/files/media/image/2026/01/Volue_logo_black_9_RGB.png" alt width="158" height="45"></p><p>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://www.smartpulse.io/">Smartpulse Global Limited</a></td><td><a href="mailto:global@smartpulse.io">global@smartpulse.io</a></td><td>+44 7594 090 783</td><td><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src="/sites/default/files/media/image/2026/01/smartpulse%20logo.png" alt width="294" height="83"></p><p>&nbsp;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
      
      </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

      </div>
</div>
          </div>
  
  </div>

</article>

      </div>

  </div>


